7,"Ontenu language. Evangelism tools, church planting resources...",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/ont,"Download Ontenu - Good News.mp3. Audio recordings available in Ontenu. These recordings are designed for evangelism and basic Bible teaching to bring the gospel message to people who are not literate or are from oral cultures, particularly unreached people groups.",Ontenu,Trans-New Guinea
